{"type":"text","timestamp":1770759727045,"sessionID":"ses_3b6802c31ffelB555qOEnlesSu","part":{"id":"prt_c49811c0e0010uecdrsovt5q1C","sessionID":"ses_3b6802c31ffelB555qOEnlesSu","messageID":"msg_c49810a25001GMDYGXdLlAcmXs","type":"text","text":"I've created the server component `ThemeInfo` that reads the \"theme\" cookie and \"Accept-Language\" header as requested.\n\n### 1. Created the Server Component\nI created `app/components/ThemeInfo.tsx` which uses `next/headers` to access the request data. It defaults the theme to \"light\" if the cookie is missing and displays the preferred language.\n\n```tsx\nimport { cookies, headers } from 'next/headers';\n\nexport default async function ThemeInfo() {\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n  const theme = cookieStore.get('theme')?.value || 'light';\n\n  const headersList = await headers();\n  const acceptLanguage = headersList.get('accept-language');\n\n  const containerStyle = {\n    padding: '20px',\n    border: '1px solid #ccc',\n    borderRadius: '8px',\n    maxWidth: '400px',\n    fontFamily: 'system-ui, sans-serif',\n    backgroundColor: theme === 'dark' ? '#333' : '#fff',\n    color: theme === 'dark' ? '#fff' : '#000',\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div style={containerStyle}>\n      <h2 style={{ marginTop: 0 }}>User Preferences</h2>\n      <p>\n        <strong>Theme:</strong> {theme}\n      </p>\n      <p>\n        <strong>Preferred Language:</strong> {acceptLanguage || 'Unknown'}\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Integrated into the Main Page\nI updated `app/page.tsx` to include this component so you can see it in action immediately.\n\n```tsx\nimport ThemeInfo from './components/ThemeInfo';\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return (\n    <main style={{ padding: '2rem', fontFamily: 'system-ui, sans-serif' }}>\n      <h1>User Preferences Dashboard</h1>\n      <ThemeInfo />\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nThe component is fully dynamic and will update based on the incoming request cookies and headers.","time":{"start":1770759727044,"end":1770759727044},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
